{"evt":"knowledge_added","id":"note-mqaq4jbmqs6","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","item":{"key":"batch-generator-drop-bug","value":"batch.js process() silently drops records past index 1000 when input is a generator/iterator. The guard condition checks !Array.isArray(input) and breaks after i >= 1000. Fix: materialize with Array.from(records()) before calling process()."},"actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-12T09:28:14.293Z"}
{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqaq4jbmqs6","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"batch process silently drops records after 1000 for generator input","summary":"batch.js process() has a known bug: when passed a generator or iterator (non-array iterable), it exits after 1000 records. Workaround: always materialize to array first with Array.from(records()) before passing to process(). This is a workspace-known issue, not fixed upstream.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-12T09:28:14.290Z","vec":[-0.0602116584777832,0.056971002370119095,-0.04141170158982277,0.04610361531376839,-0.038783106952905655,-0.04459458962082863,0.0006101825856603682,0.03321219980716705,-0.03267975524067879,-0.01396632194519043,0.042636688798666,-0.03190765529870987,0.015325254760682583,-0.1290343552827835,-0.05877774581313133,-0.02969781868159771,-0.026169974356889725,-0.05297330021858215,-0.04830831289291382,-0.10062002390623093,-0.04700803384184837,0.03316524624824524,0.028514282777905464,0.04543019458651543,-0.019402259960770607,-0.031780894845724106,-0.041948702186346054,-0.04972697049379349,0.051446959376335144,-0.024793246760964394,-0.008298642002046108,0.07570073753595352,-0.0404941663146019,0.04653439670801163,0.17122997343540192,0.06215864419937134,0.006190531887114048,0.04023987799882889,0.017877662554383278,-0.040269799530506134,0.11217407137155533,0.04067698121070862,-0.021746385842561722,0.07623830437660217,0.021275678649544716,0.035889867693185806,-0.04435122385621071,-0.0338582843542099,-0.0058129276148974895,0.004606165457516909,-0.08508776128292084,0.07185244560241699,0.10894209891557693,-0.006475229747593403,-0.07834561914205551,-0.031202485784888268,0.10382108390331268,0.02880704402923584,-0.0398559495806694,0.01580451801419258,-0.06457890570163727,-0.02251390740275383,-0.10325732082128525,-0.06678483635187149,0.008675801567733288,-0.016513606533408165,0.043429356068372726,0.006879151798784733,0.014453455805778503,-0.0034381027799099684,0.05467895418405